<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - AK STEEL CUT ON PRICE.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - AK STEEL CUT ON PRICE.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said analyst Michelle Galanter Applebaum cut AK Steel Holding Corp to buy from strong buy due to the stock's price.</p>
<p>-- said in past three months stock has risen 30 percent and is now trading within 20 percent of $60 target.</p>
<p>-- shares were off 15/16 to 47-1/16.</p>
</text>
